        <mxCell id="not" value="&lt;b&gt;Neden modul basina iki proje?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Domain projesi hicbir NuGet paketi icermez. Bu, klasor duzeniyle degil&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;derleyiciyle&lt;/b&gt; garanti edilir: aggregate icine EF Core using'i eklenemez,&lt;br&gt;cunku paket o projede yok.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Moduller neden birbirini gormez?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Iletisim yalnizca integration event ile olur. Tasks modulu Stock'u&lt;br&gt;dogrudan cagirsaydi modul siniri yalnizca isimlendirmede kalirdi." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
